WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.280
The Qur'an tells how,
before the first human,

2
00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:05.410
Allah spoke to the angels.

3
00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:08.200
He would place a new
creature on the Earth.

4
00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:09.950
The angels were worried.

5
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.600
Would it cause mischief and shed blood?

6
00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:16.930
Today humans can pollute rivers
and waste what the Earth gives.

7
00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:21.040
So, if Muslims believe the
Earth was placed in human hands,

8
00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:24.250
are humans its owners, or something else?

9
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:27.460
In this mission, you'll
meet Adam, made from clay,

10
00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:30.910
and find out what Muslims
believe he learned from Allah.

11
00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:34.520
Then you'll read the Qur'an's
own words about the first human,

12
00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:37.460
and test your answer on one man's choice.

13
00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:41.910
Your mission: find out whether Muslims
see humans as the Earth's owners,

14
00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:43.470
or as something else.
